{# STEP 3 — PEOPLE & EVIDENCE, AND EVERYTHING ELSE THAT CAN WAIT.

   D'S RULING, IN BOTH CONTAINERS. Nothing in this section is required to file,
   and it says so in the only grammar that is honest about it: add it now, or add
   it on the record afterwards. The append-only timeline is what makes that true
   rather than a promise — every later fact carries the person who added it and
   the moment they did, which is strictly more truthful than the same facts typed
   by one person at the roadside and stamped as if they were all known at once.

   Parameters: prefill, compact
   ========================================================================== #}
<p class="use"{{ compact ? ' style="margin:0 0 4px"' : '' }}>
    {%- if prefill.hasProvenance -%}
        Whatever the {{ prefill.sourceLabel }} carried travels with this filing. Anyone involved — the claimant, a
        witness, the officer who attended — can be added here or on the record afterwards.
    {%- else -%}
        Anyone involved — the claimant, a witness, the officer who attended — and anything that shows what happened can
        be added here or on the record afterwards.
    {%- endif -%}
</p>

<div class="ro-later">
    <div class="lrow"><b>Then, on the record</b><span>everything below is offered on the case file the moment it exists,
            and the timeline keeps who added it and when</span></div>
    <div class="lrow"><b>How bad</b><span>defaults to medium; whoever verifies it decides properly</span>
        <span class="sp"></span><span class="ro-opt">can wait</span></div>
    <div class="lrow"><b>People</b><span>claimant, witness, attending officer</span>
        <span class="sp"></span><span class="ro-opt">can wait</span></div>
    <div class="lrow"><b>Evidence</b><span>photographs and documents, kept with their original timestamps</span>
        <span class="sp"></span><span class="ro-opt">can wait</span></div>
    <div class="lrow"><b>Money</b><span>only where the kind carries it, and only once assessed</span>
        <span class="sp"></span><span class="ro-opt">can wait</span></div>
</div>
